<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to June 9.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to June 9.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of crop development by Monday.</p>
<p>CROP     EMERGED	    TILLERED/ROSETTE</p>
<p>	  1997  92/96 Avg   1997  92/96 Avg</p>
<p>S.Wheat  73	76	  21	20</p>
<p>Oats     61	70	  11	 9</p>
<p>Barley   69	69	  14	11</p>
<p>Canola   67	71	  11	 4</p>
<p>Flax     92	75	   8	 5</p>
<p>Peas     84	86	  13	 0</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
